# U45: open party_plain (an empty Party section) from the build list, the Party button, then
# paste a whole build code with every ExportedBuffs section into the code edit
# (importCodeHandle: "Code is valid"), RETURN (the edit's enterFunc: finishImport with
# destination All, replace: clearInputText, SetText and ParseBuffs of each section, the simple
# labels and their line counts moving the labels below them), a recalc, Show Advanced Info (the
# edits replace the labels), Ctrl+S (Save writes ImportedBuffs and the attributes, lastContent:
# modFlag clears), then Clear with destination All (every edit and label emptied, enemyModList
# replaced, a recalc) and a snapshot.
